   "section": "Manage and refer urgently:",
   "section_y": 198.5,
   "indent": 3,
   "parent": "p82-rb1-e19",
   "text": "If contact < 6 years old, give ceftriaxone3 125mg IM as a single dose (dissolve ceftriaxone 250mg in 0.9mL lidocaine 1% without adrenaline (epinephrine); discard half the volume and inject the rest).",
