   "section_y": 198.5,
   "indent": 3,
   "parent": "p82-rb1-e19",
   "text": "If contact ≥12 years, give ciprofloxacin 500mg as a single dose. If pregnant, give instead ceftriaxone3 250mg IM (dissolve ceftriaxone 250mg in 0.9mL lidocaine 1% without adrenaline (epinephrine)).",
